# Everything this plugin ships is parsed as text by something: the frontmatter reader in
# `codex/lib.mjs`, the Python hooks, the gates. A clone with CRLF broke the first of those
# silently — `^---\n` does not match `---\r\n`, so every agent and command-as-skill was dropped
# and the installer still reported success. Git for Windows checks out CRLF by default, so the
# repository has to say otherwise.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
